    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now Jericho was straitly shut up because of the children of Israel: none went out, and none came in.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.6.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.6.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "said unto Joshua, See, I have given into thine hand Jericho, and the king thereof,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.6.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.6.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the mighty men of valour.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And ye shall compass the city, all",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "ye",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.6.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.6.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "men of war,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.6.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.6.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "go round about the city once. Thus shalt thou do six days.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And seven priests shall bear before the ark seven trumpets of rams' horns: and the seventh day ye shall compass the city seven times, and the priests shall blow with the trumpets.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And it shall come to pass, that when they make a long",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "blast",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.6.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.6.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "with the ram's horn,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.6.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.6.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "when ye hear the sound of the trumpet, all the people shall shout with a great shout; and the wall of the city shall fall down flat, and the people shall ascend up every man straight before him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ And Joshua the son of Nun called the priests, and said unto them, Take up the ark of the covenant, and let seven priests bear seven trumpets of rams' horns before the ark of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.6.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.6.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he said unto the people, Pass on, and compass the city, and let him that is armed pass on before the ark of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.6.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.6.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ And it came to pass, when Joshua had spoken unto the people, that the seven priests bearing the seven trumpets of rams' horns passed on before the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.6.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.6.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", and blew with the trumpets: and the ark of the covenant of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.6.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.6.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "followed them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ And the armed men went before the priests that blew with the trumpets, and the rereward came after the ark,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "the priests",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.6.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.6.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "going on, and blowing with the trumpets.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Joshua had commanded the people, saying, Ye shall not shout, nor make any noise with your voice, neither shall",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "any",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.6.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.6.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "word proceed out of your mouth, until the day I bid you shout; then shall ye shout.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So the ark of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.6.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.6.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "compassed the city, going about",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.6.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.6.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "once: and they came into the camp, and lodged in the camp.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ And Joshua rose early in the morning, and the priests took up the ark of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.6.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.6.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And seven priests bearing seven trumpets of rams' horns before the ark of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.6.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.6.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "went on continually, and blew with the trumpets: and the armed men went before them; but the rereward came after the ark of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.6.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.6.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ",",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "the priests",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.6.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.6.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "going on, and blowing with the trumpets.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the second day they compassed the city once, and returned into the camp: so they did six days.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And it came to pass on the seventh day, that they rose early about the dawning of the day, and compassed the city after the same manner seven times: only on that day they compassed the city seven times.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And it came to pass at the seventh time, when the priests blew with the trumpets, Joshua said unto the people, Shout; for the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JOS.6.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JOS.6.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hath given you the city.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.6.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
